 null, 'Multiple myeloma results from the malignant, clonal proliferation of plasma cells in the bone marrow, producing excess monoclonal antibody (M protein).'),
('NEET PG', 'Pre- and Para-Clinical Sciences', 'Pathology', 'hard', 'mcq',
